        "faq_j3VC6V": {
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This Cookie Policy explains how SL US Inc. uses cookies and similar technologies on our US website at www.solacelondon.com/gb-us (the “Site”), and how you can control them. SL US Inc. operates the United States version of our website. You can contact us at any time at help@solacelondon.com or by phone at (929) 725-3507. It should be read together with our US Privacy Policy, which explains how we handle your personal information. We use cookies in accordance with applicable US state privacy laws.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_eBNGnc": {
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When you visit the Site, our web server sends a cookie to your computer. Cookies are small pieces of information which are issued to your computer when you visit a website and which store and sometimes track information about your use of the Site. A number of cookies we use last only for the duration of your web session and expire when you close your browser. Other cookies are used to remember you when you return to the Site and will last for longer.&nbsp;</p><p>We use cookies to remember that you have visited us before (so we can gauge visitor numbers and make sure we have enough capacity), to customise the layout and content of the pages of the Site, to collect statistical information about how the Site is used and where visitors come from so that we can improve it, and to gather information about the pages you visit — and other sites you visit — so as to place you in a “market segment” and show interest-based advertisements.&nbsp;</p><p>Some of the cookies used by the Site are set by us, and some are set by third parties who deliver services on our behalf.&nbsp;</p><p>We use non-essential cookies — including functional, analytics, performance and advertising cookies — to improve your experience, understand how the Site is used, and support advertising. You can accept, reject or manage these cookies at any time through our cookie banner and preferences tool (see “Managing your cookies” below). Strictly necessary cookies, which the Site needs in order to function, are always active. In addition, most web browsers let you block or delete cookies, or notify you each time a cookie is set. You can also learn more about cookies at allaboutcookies.org. Please note, however, that by blocking or deleting cookies used on the Site, you may not be able to take full advantage of it. &nbsp;</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_64MGJM": {
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>You can accept, reject or manage non-essential cookies at any time using our cookie preferences tool, available via <a>Consent Preferences</a>. Non-essential cookies remain off until you consent to them, and you can withdraw your consent at any time — it is as easy to reject cookies as it is to accept them. We may ask you to confirm your choices again from time to time.&nbsp;</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_BJfXcz": {
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Please submit any questions, concerns or comments about this Cookie Policy, or any requests concerning your personal data, by email to <a href=\"mailto:help@solacelondon.com\">help@solacelondon.com.</a> Post: SL US Inc., 16192 Coastal Highway, Lewes, Delaware 19958, United States.</p>"
          }
        }
